# HeartOfWarding (13001), talked to with no Antharas in the world: its first page 13001-01.htm,
# then the entry answers 13001-02.htm (global memo keys 4, 5 and 6 unset). Expectations are
# derived from the reference source (HeartOfWarding.java 36-40, 70-127). The Portal Stone entry,
# the boss wait and the script event to the small, normal or large Antharas, and the refusals
# 13001-03.htm and 13001-04.htm are in tests/ai/boss_antharas_heart_test.go: the format declares
# no npcmaker of its own type, so it places no Antharas with a spawn_data row.
character Hunter 20
script script.ai.boss.antharas.HeartOfWarding
page script/ai/boss/antharas/HeartOfWarding/
npc heart 13001 Folk 60 0 0

action heart
action heart
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=heart item=0 page=script/ai/boss/antharas/HeartOfWarding/13001-01.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass Quest HeartOfWarding enter
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=heart item=0 page=script/ai/boss/antharas/HeartOfWarding/13001-02.htm
  S ActionFailed
